  {
    "type": "function",
    "function": {
      "name": "submit_outline_scan",
      "description": "Commit inspected delivered text, grid and collection metadata ranges. Entries are upserts; omitted saved issues remain open. Use returned IDs for updates. In outline phase, add or revise conclusions with previously inspected, confirmed evidence and empty scan-range maps. Classify independent materials separately; constraints do not become standalone chapters. Use read_outline(kind=blockers) for actionable repair IDs. On failure, fix all returned errors together using repair {call_id,arguments_sha256,changes:[{path,value}]}; do not resend the full batch. Repair and full submission are mutually exclusive. All entry types accept empty or tmp- IDs to allocate, and existing stable IDs to update; id_map is grouped by category.",
